      "citation": "Anstey KJ, et al. Body mass index in midlife and late-life as a risk factor for dementia: a meta-analysis of prospective studies. Obes Rev. 2011;12(5):e426-e437",
      "doi": "10.1111/j.1467-789X.2010.00825.x",
      "notes": "U-shaped: midlife obesity pooled RR 1.64 (any dementia) / 2.04 (AD); midlife underweight RR ~1.96 for AD. Valid for MIDLIFE BMI; the association attenuates/reverses when BMI is measured near dementia onset (late life)."
    },
